00:58:28.270 --> 00:58:35.830
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]
<v Ira Glass>[资助鸣谢]

00:58:35.830 --> 00:58:43.050
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who every single day calls me into his office, points to a picture of Garrison Keillor and says--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，他每天都叫我进办公室，指着一张加里森·凯勒的照片说——

00:58:43.050 --> 00:58:44.340
<v Manny Howard>Let's get him.
<v Manny Howard>搞定他。

00:58:44.340 --> 00:58:55.050
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:55.050 --> 00:59:00.050
